  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project CEV III: Promotion of Ethical Recruitment and Evaluation of Housing Conditions for Migrant Workers in Spain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the housing conditions of seasonal migrant workers, working in the agricultural sector in Spain. The project will contribute to a better understanding of all technical aspects and minimum standards that need to be fulfilled in order to guarantee decent living conditions of migrant workers in Spain.</narrative>
  </description>
